{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40080","headline":"自咏十韵 · 徐夤","name":"自咏十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"只合沧洲钓与耕，忽依萤烛愧功成。\n未游宦路叨卑宦，才到名场得大名。\n梁苑二年陪衆客，温陵十载佐双旌。\n钱财尽是侯王惠，骨肉偕承里巷荣。\n拙赋偏闻镌印卖，恶诗亲见画图呈多栽桃李期春色，阔凿池塘许月明。\n寒益轻裯饶美寝，出乘车马免徒行。\n麤支菽粟防饥歉，薄有桮盘备送迎。\n僧俗共邻栖隐乐，妻孥同爱水云清。\n如今便死还甘分，莫更嫌他白发生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40080.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40080","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}